{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "g-aw",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "📊 ActivityWatch 采集与同步",
   "x": -18,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 644,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "aw-watchers",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "aw-watcher-window / aw-watcher-afk\n• 前台窗口标题 ~1s；AFK ~180s 超时\n• 随登录启动（D:\\ActivityWatch）",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 81,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "aw-server",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "aw-server + Web UI :5600（仅本机）\n• SQLite 原始事件（peewee-sqlite.v2.db）\n• classes 分类: 层级深度优先，不改历史\n• 规则源: categories-v5.json（设置页导入）",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 107,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "aw-sync",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "5 分钟同步计划任务\n• run-activitywatch-sync-hidden.vbs 隐藏启动\n• push-activitywatch.ps1 → aw-sync.exe push\n• 输出 C:\\Users\\15345\\ActivityWatchSync",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 229,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "aw-st",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "同步状态与日志\n• %LOCALAPPDATA%\\ActivityWatchPiSync\\\n  status.json（ok=false → 先开 AW 再手动跑）\n  logs\\sync-YYYY-MM-DD.log",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 351,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "aw-syncthing",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Syncthing（Windows，send-only）\n• 登录启动；传输端口 22000\n• GUI 仅 127.0.0.1:8384；设备名 RaspberryPi",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 473,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 81,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-obs",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "📝 Obsidian 与番茄钟",
   "x": 474,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 612,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "ob-vault",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "Obsidian Vault（唯一事实源）\n• 非笔记内容/任务计划/Profile.md\n• ToDo-任务集合.md（⚠️待正式安排区）\n• ToDo-已经规划好的任务.md / 番茄钟log.md\n• 新任务行尾 ^blockid（8 位）",
   "x": 492,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "ob-export",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Behavior Context Exporter\n• 计划任务每 20 分钟兜底 + 插件手动触发\n• 输出 C:\\Users\\15345\\BehaviorContextSync\\\n  context_snapshot.json + raw 文件\n• lock 文件防并发写坏",
   "x": 492,
   "y": 137,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "ob-plugin",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Pi Context Sync 插件\n• 唯一 Markdown 写入者（mutation queue → 文件）\n• 一键同步: 保存 note → exporter → 远端校验\n• SSH SHA-256 比对（12s 连接 / 45s 窗口）\n• 提示「暂未确认接收」≠ 失败（Syncthing 重试）",
   "x": 492,
   "y": 274,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "ob-pomodoro",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "New Pomodoro Timer（v1.2.3-focus-garden.8）\n• 5s 读 /api/bootstrap +「刷新云端进度」\n• Work 5/20/30/40/45/60（默认 40）\n• Break 0/5/10/15/20/30；暂停 1–120min\n• 暂停一次 → 该轮半额结算",
   "x": 492,
   "y": 411,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-agent",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "🔒 介入 Agent 域",
   "x": 966,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 734,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "ag-agent",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Computer Intervention Agent（agent.py）\n• 5s 轮询 pending → 先 ack → Tkinter 弹窗\n• → Cold Turkey 执行 → final 回执\n• 5min heartbeat（POST /heartbeat）\n• allowlist: 常刷网站 / bilibili（30min）\n• ⚠️ 启动形态: 普通后台进程 vs 登录计划任务\n  两版文档冲突（待确认）",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 141,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "ag-coldturkey",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Cold Turkey Blocker.exe\n• 命令: -start '<block>' -lock 30\n• block 名须与 CT GUI 完全一致\n• status=success 仅表示命令提交成功\n  （v1 无法反查真实封锁状态）",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 167,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "ag-ui",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "status_ui.py 状态面板\n• 只读: agent 进程/Pi API/pending/拒绝计数\n• 按钮: 启动 agent / 刷新（关闭仅关 UI）",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 304,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 81,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "ag-state",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "本地状态\n• D:\\tools\\computer-intervention-agent\\\n  state.json + data\\agent.log\n• config.json: api_base 用 MagicDNS",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 411,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "wx-guard",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "微信视频陪伴提醒（独立闭环）\n• 注册表摄像头占用检测 → 置顶提醒 →\n  可选 30min 封锁（复用 CT block）\n• 不依赖 Pi/网络；登录启动；state.json\n  5s 刷新 + events.jsonl 审计",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 533,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-mgmt",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "🛠️ 管理支撑",
   "x": 1458,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 430,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "clash",
   "color": "2",
   "text": "Clash Verge 代理 + fix-bypass\n• ProxyOverride 直连 pi.taild4d3f7.ts.net\n• 登录脚本 + 计划任务写回注册表\n• ⚠️ 任务周期 1min vs 5min（文档冲突）",
   "x": 1476,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "mgr-migrate",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "D:\\PiClientMigration（迁移基线）\n• CURRENT.json 唯一版本指针\n• install-client-tasks.ps1 建 5 个规范任务\n• ⚠️ CURRENT 记录 1.3.1 vs 已装 1.3.3",
   "x": 1476,
   "y": 122,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "mgr-garden",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "开发/镜像副本（非权威）\n• D:\\MyFocusGarden（开发回滚副本）\n• D:\\MyFocusGardenArchive\\focus-garden.sqlite3\n  （receive-only + staggered 历史）",
   "x": 1476,
   "y": 244,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
