   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-ctx",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "Pi: behavior-context-sync（receive-only）\n• context_snapshot.json → context_cache\n• 判断 sync_heartbeat 的新鲜度",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 107,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 81,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-8450",
   "color": "5",
   "text": ":8450 advisor-web（tailnet-only）\n• 介入 API: pending / ack / response / heartbeat\n• ⚠️ auth_required=false 与旧文档 401\n  记录并存（待确认，现免密码）",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 214,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-8460",
   "color": "5",
   "text": ":8460 focus-garden（tailnet-only）\n• GET /api/bootstrap；POST /api/focus/\n  start | pause | resume（Pi 会话权威）\n• 一轮 Work 最多暂停一次",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 336,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-taskq",
   "color": "3",
   "text": "Pi: data/task_sync/state.json\n• 网页 mutation queue（非权威）\n• ack 语义校验: 快照真实包含变更才清除\n• 循环任务只读投影（不改写 Markdown）",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 458,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
